    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d899">

                <pb facs="0970" n="868" xml:id="pg868"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.6363/8: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Costa
                        Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hale</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1915-12-22T11:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 22,
                                1915, 11 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Confidential. Your number 88, November 15, and subsequent telegrams.<anchor
                        n="36" xml:id="d899-f1"/></p>
                <p>Report by telegraph when concession will be submitted to Congress. Department
                    also desires your views regarding monopolistic features and generally whether
                    the concession is advantageous to Costa Rica.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
